      "prompt": "Write a Python function top_k_frequent(words, k) that returns the k most frequent strings in the list words, ordered by frequency (highest first); words with the same frequency are ordered alphabetically. If there are fewer than k distinct words, return all of them.",
      "reference": [
        "def top_k_frequent(words, k):",
        "    counts = {}",
